{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>YHWH Elohei etc. like you etc.</b> The meaning is: righteous ones like you, a thousand times over. Corresponding to this multiplication He said <b>may He bless you as He spoke</b> etc. And our Sages of blessed memory said (Sifrei): 'This is from me' etc. And the intention of the entire teaching is to mention His name, may He be blessed, upon them even when He mentioned their praise in a good measure — that they are righteous, likened to the stars — in the manner we explained regarding the verse ״YHWH Eloheikhem has multiplied you,״ where He mentioned His name, may He be blessed, upon them when He mentioned multiplications."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:14:13.209104543Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}